      "description": "Scenic Beauty Estimation (SBE): 13 photographs of road green space sample points in Yangling, China (G grass, S shrub, T tree; Z traffic separation zone, R roadside greenbelt, A avenue greenbelt), shown one at a time in random order. Everyone rates how much they like the scene on 5 levels: 1 very dislike, 2 not too much, 3 average, 4 more like, 5 like. Landscape professionals additionally score the paper's eight landscape character indicators (Table 1, 1–5 each). Value: {sbe} for the public, {sbe, floristics, configuration, canopy_density, growing_status, leaf, vertical_greening, spatial, harmony} for professionals. Analysis as in the paper: per participant z-standardise SBE scores, average per sample point = SBE value; standardised mean of the eight indicators = landscape character value; Scenic Beauty Index SBI = 0.5 × SBE + 0.5 × character value."
